+Feature: DOM identity preservation
+  As a user
+  I want the todo list to update smoothly when I change item state
+  So that my browser can track interactive elements without interruption
+
+  Background:
+    Given the app has todos "Buy groceries" and "Clean house"
+
+  Scenario: Toggling a single todo preserves its DOM element
+    When the user toggles the "Buy groceries" todo checkbox
+    Then the "Buy groceries" todo element is the same DOM node as before the toggle
+    And the "Buy groceries" todo has class "completed"
+    And the "Clean house" todo element is the same DOM node as before the toggle
+
+  Scenario: Toggling all todos preserves DOM elements
+    When the user clicks the toggle all checkbox
+    Then the "Buy groceries" todo element is the same DOM node as before the toggle
+    And the "Clean house" todo element is the same DOM node as before the toggle
+    And all todos have class "completed"
